{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/r2szpsfbbdj52io6cw1uzvasnrvfz9s.mp3","text":"别去刻意寻找，我一直在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/oulcucn4oqxdb9hg21i22tinpmqfn8t.mp3","text":"黑夜中的人无法给你指路，也看不到你指出的方向。别停留，你该离开了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/53/460a910bdtky17qyn1lyyer6fsjutcp.mp3","text":"在这副假面之下，我认不出自己是谁。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/ocby2i62setvylxfm7u7y5meco88sfd.mp3","text":"这位是Miss.Christine。我不知道她从哪里来，也不知道她会在什么时候离开。如果她喜欢你，她会主动靠近......没错，像现在这样。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/d2vlk1tqs4w7jumjr0lcvjrxskvyxlf.mp3","text":"曾经的我也并非孤身一人。我有过一些伙伴，作为一个小剧团四处周游。但当矿石病爆发蔓延，一切到此结束，一切又由此而始......","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/fh4ivifku2z06i8t3zs7ywcsq5vprwa.mp3","text":"这片黑暗是庇护所，也是宝座，更是乐园。过去的亡灵从未离去，而我在他们的骸骨上诅咒这一切......看到我这副模样，你还想聆听我的歌声，你还敢...站在我身前吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/fzpjdn5n46k3ulhev8cml7rztxmodmp.mp3","text":"喉咙上的这个装置压迫着我的脖颈，但这正是我需要的。和面具一样，它遮掩了我的罪恶，隐藏了我的声音。想听我真正的声音？不，不能。这不是你该承受的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/07/q07uwmza1zu3vi4h5l0cq7bohc426sg.mp3","text":"我的歌声结束了所有人的生命。无止境的夜，不停止的歌，那些从喉咙里呕出的发颤高音和内脏碎片，令人恐惧，也让人窒息......却又那么......美妙。博士，你告诉我，我到底......在做什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/se7lv7wkeu0ovezkjmbwu9rrh8za7l6.mp3","text":"我能帮你取走许多生命，但我必须先确认自己是否清醒。有什么在尝试左右我，它不愿我走下舞台，它想让歌声永远回荡下去......甚至去杀死你。再次扮演你的刺客前，我必须先找到真相。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/r2ko0wu3nbr0ug0x0ne3mggmt1m8gmk.mp3","text":"即使现在并非黑夜，黑影也不曾离开你的身边。小心你那些不合时宜的睡意，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/900328959534i6e42dzu0uce5e3l2vr.mp3","text":"代号傀影，黑夜中的幽灵，幕布后的幻影。告诉我，你的敌人在哪，是谁......","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/5bv0uv8vztxdykpdu1y67ryffwvv5yw.mp3","text":"杀戮不是目的，而是手段。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/1y6wb7buzqsdo8b1xlvg648hetjn65w.mp3","text":"如你所愿。罗德岛的曲调由你来定，你不需要引导或保护......是的，我很清楚。你才是你自己的主人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/9tkvg8bojoyl1g6aiokdsy05pz4kr57.mp3","text":"这一步无法回头，无法后望。我将与你分享的东西，恐怕并不像你想象中那样美妙。......过来，来这里，这黑夜的幕布，就让我为你揭开。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/8f25mhsyjktax3u6h0sb7rezh0mpsd7.mp3","text":"该我登台了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/q16z63bvxfokas7ntz1aiq7n22ltgf3.mp3","text":"给与引导，这我不陌生。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/bal1gccuci0v09vbhfmxrtq76wnwyet.mp3","text":"就按你所说的方向......","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/6ip7n81an5745tywm1f7opw6zfm1xnx.mp3","text":"戏剧该揭开它的帷幕了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/1a51mun83elrl7youtfap84rfg2uwvj.mp3","text":"我在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/34/dirk1shem3s6hgoicnwm6yv2fre3rjh.mp3","text":"那么，潜入夜幕吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/s7qhox51tod4cftfi4ozopwv9xkx2jm.mp3","text":"我自暗影中现身。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/tmme4ntwyui7t4phxe4jjrc1yt0knr4.mp3","text":"听我的声音。听我歌唱。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/f5bmn34jdhb40qe4tz4vak03xny8t6u.mp3","text":"看到镜中你自己的脸了吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/242ap8603hencryvikobdv7d3x3y2mf.mp3","text":"演员是台词的傀儡。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/4stmeuj81jgrk5wfjszwree03wga348.mp3","text":"有罪者......当受罚。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/9opu4fweeqlo9g4s3vkkay82ai9j5vq.mp3","text":"为了我——歌唱吧！歌唱吧！歌唱吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/nyoupgxzckiieo3w1hybdfljn7lq6nx.mp3","text":"这就是由你引导而来的胜利吗......","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/fv89jo9kq9vne2653s2h5w2d49xmf4s.mp3","text":"结束了。胜利并不甜美，纷争总是孕化了其它滋味。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/5ud09j04bkrgl53fn0fkp4affwygwxa.mp3","text":"被他们逃了。对他们来说是件好事......对我来说，或许也是。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/g99qi0vyo8dnf0t3zejgcbifu1x9jdj.mp3","text":"撤退。......你已经迷失了方向。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/gs1n5x41coyj7sy6qu68pmem4yos86x.mp3","text":"嗯？这面镜子后面，似乎......","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/mms6bp33wd57kcowmg7r1jycsjb5e21.mp3","text":"什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/nwlo4dipejjvum1s4y0jlz54xngqv69.mp3","text":"这个脚步声......是你，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/6ldjflt89nil53h4hgagv5y68hki9da.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/e9xj46zxnbaebvomodkmz2knv9fod3y.mp3","text":"时光流逝是一件值得庆祝的事情吗？我们真的能够与往日作别吗？由我这个被厄运缠身的人为您送上祝福或许并不适宜......但新的一年，影子会继续跟随在您身后。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/cv3qbz0qvpbnxiiullmiidg2tktov5y.mp3","text":"你身后的影子看起来比昨天更沉重，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_250_phatom/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/7mucqutno50rdyud8l8y041zqi2m1wn.mp3","text":"别去刻意寻找，我一直在。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/8pdhho4w6pp37tulw4n9cgrii34ygor.mp3","text":"黑夜中的人无法给你指路，也看不到你指出的方向。别停留，你该离开了......","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/a83047l7qgpe0eeba8xdfw7hnep8fti.mp3","text":"在这副假面之下，我认不出自己是谁。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/hgt7qowpvxt0os9qvlda7tcn1lobghj.mp3","text":"这位是Miss.Christine。我不知道她从哪里来，也不知道她会在什么时候离开。如果她喜欢你，她会主动靠近......没错，像现在这样。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/j5yrkc1t0c8j85uk0ob2i5vc32tztcu.mp3","text":"曾经的我也并非孤身一人。我有过一些伙伴，作为一个小剧团四处周游。但当矿石病爆发蔓延，一切到此结束，一切又由此而始......","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/f4v1vccjv1ttxceidvigf5cl497c3tv.mp3","text":"这片黑暗是庇护所，也是宝座，更是乐园。过去的亡灵从未离去，而我在他们的骸骨上诅咒这一切......看到我这副模样，你还想聆听我的歌声，你还敢...站在我身前吗？","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/709lgzh59xv5akph0u2rn72j4iw4rl4.mp3","text":"喉咙上的这个装置压迫着我的脖颈，但这正是我需要的。和面具一样，它遮掩了我的罪恶，隐藏了我的声音。想听我真正的声音？不，不能。这不是你该承受的......","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/h6p06fqrywbpaqe00c0mvbswocbvfez.mp3","text":"我的歌声结束了所有人的生命。无止境的夜，不停止的歌，那些从喉咙里呕出的发颤高音和内脏碎片，令人恐惧，也让人窒息......却又那么......美妙。博士，你告诉我，我到底......在做什么？","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/ihrb4rlenfdofjjfx7w4ljtlu3ze8t5.mp3","text":"我能帮你取走许多生命，但我必须先确认自己是否清醒。有什么在尝试左右我，它不愿我走下舞台，它想让歌声永远回荡下去......甚至去杀死你。再次扮演你的刺客前，我必须先找到真相。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/gdhhnx9fule7f14hjojrwbcs4bd4j0y.mp3","text":"即使现在并非黑夜，黑影也不曾离开你的身边。小心你那些不合时宜的睡意，博士。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/smfklxbqnuj02ojyw573bvxmnxyaa2x.mp3","text":"代号傀影，黑夜中的幽灵，幕布后的幻影。告诉我，你的敌人在哪，是谁......","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/lp4wcm66oja04ym2m7fwam9dx7dct7l.mp3","text":"杀戮不是目的，而是手段。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/ll20xb6308t6bo98r7d0w9we7lqahmf.mp3","text":"如你所愿。罗德岛的曲调由你来定，你不需要引导或保护......是的，我很清楚。你才是你自己的主人。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/pdmuo0t78uolkcfggcxqgsjte68awt9.mp3","text":"这一步无法回头，无法后望。我将与你分享的东西，恐怕并不像你想象中那样美妙。......过来，来这里，这黑夜的幕布，就让我为你揭开。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/tj2arot7k67i8vidf7y3wmra99ckbed.mp3","text":"该我登台了吗？","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/6wq1bsnc5323kurwe5dnzaftfrkelpx.mp3","text":"给与引导，这我不陌生。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/81owq7k62tuxwm1uw8smzp7hvhtw4vv.mp3","text":"就按你所说的方向......","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/k322n4cegnhxan9y880nvcvqb2ik8pi.mp3","text":"戏剧该揭开它的帷幕了。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/mkdc3d0smbvkmy8mnbfuojmsedo1h07.mp3","text":"我在。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/p24zrmicujprfi07t13uh8mcu8ah3zh.mp3","text":"那么，潜入夜幕吧。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/qddr0nx5wsl4gjowgeveq4hrnqog310.mp3","text":"我自暗影中现身。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/7ml1ilvelwjdcl11j6jp8fgh2mkfe1c.mp3","text":"听我的声音。听我歌唱。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/e0orzyufwx98gxrq56nmhhx304p30rh.mp3","text":"看到镜中你自己的脸了吗。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/et0fhp36qeylt4ql447b8u2odud68jc.mp3","text":"演员是台词的傀儡。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/7z2ltp4qqahelsmd0ydukp9q9hwlv3j.mp3","text":"有罪者......当受罚。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/3b9o16ztz3vu9baq5lbeixfakycgciz.mp3","text":"为了我——歌唱吧！歌唱吧！歌唱吧！","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/tkauyns4f42ztlmlpx599dbhuc31lum.mp3","text":"这就是由你引导而来的胜利吗......","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/7ub1dyszj4slqzfy9sie0micslqxy76.mp3","text":"结束了。胜利并不甜美，纷争总是孕化了其它滋味。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/hty9b507pgfywawr8z4795adqq9678g.mp3","text":"被他们逃了。对他们来说是件好事......对我来说，或许也是。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/2nm8r5vft40my4rieabagu4u97gny3z.mp3","text":"撤退。......你已经迷失了方向。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/fauutpp26tjy0pn1ou3b9xfep34z09x.mp3","text":"嗯？这面镜子后面，似乎......","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/00hoxyex5rrl9vq17ottfi202lz26n3.mp3","text":"什么？","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/i2bztr77kfpn5jmz3sznxieg6ihsg04.mp3","text":"这个脚步声......是你，博士。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/4lmtv8ct7smt5u71lybhpalpyqbdpdq.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/dh106do7n1mo83k22r60asarurikfh1.mp3","text":"时光流逝是一件值得庆祝的事情吗？我们真的能够与往日作别吗？由我这个被厄运缠身的人为您送上祝福或许并不适宜......但新的一年，影子会继续跟随在您身后。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/t8p9zwg0vdkb0458svg25ind8m5h5y0.mp3","text":"你身后的影子看起来比昨天更沉重，博士。","alt":"voice/char_250_phatom/cn_042.mp3"}]}}